### Teste da Rota Raíz
GET http://localhost:3000/
Content-Type: application/json

### ======================================================
### AUTENTICAÇÃO
### ======================================================

### Cadastrar Cliente (rota pública - usada para criar o primeiro acesso)
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos Silva",
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "abc123",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "telefone": "11999990001"
}

### Login (retorna o token da sessão - validade de 90 minutos)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "abc123"
}

### Login com senha errada (deve retornar 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "senhaErrada"
}

### ======================================================
### CLIENTE (CRUD) - exige token no header Authorization
### ======================================================

### Listar Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Consultar Cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Atualizar Cliente
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos Silva Atualizado",
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "telefone": "11988887777"
}

### Deletar Cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/2
Authorization: {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Acesso sem token (deve retornar 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

### ======================================================
### CONSOLE
### ======================================================

### Cadastrar Console (vinculado ao cliente, número de série criptografado)
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "PlayStation 5",
  "marca": "Sony",
  "numeroSerie": "PS5-2024-ABC123",
  "tipoServico": "Limpeza e troca de pasta térmica",
  "codCliente": 1
}

### Listar Consoles
GET http://localhost:3000/consoles
Authorization: {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Consultar Console por termo (número de série)
GET http://localhost:3000/console/PS5
Authorization: {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ======================================================
### AGENDAMENTO
### ======================================================

### Cadastrar Agendamento (vinculado ao cliente e console)
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "2026-11-10",
  "hora": "14:30:00",
  "codCliente": 1,
  "codConsole": 1
}

### Listar Agendamentos (ordenado por data)
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Atualizar Agendamento
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/1
Authorization: {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "2026-11-15",
  "hora": "10:00:00",
  "codCliente": 1,
  "codConsole": 1
}
